# Skycoach Conductor's flash: Bot1 casts it in Bot2's end step on turn 6, and it enters prepared there. Its flying and
# vigilance are its own: on turn 7 it attacks without tapping (CR 702.20b) and Bot2 takes 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island x6
Skycoach Conductor
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T6 Bot2.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Skycoach Conductor.Cast
? Stack = Skycoach Conductor
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skycoach Conductor.Prepared = true
? Exile = All Aboard
Bot1.Attack(Skycoach Conductor > Bot2)
[T7 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 7
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Skycoach Conductor.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Skycoach Conductor.Keywords = Flash; Flying; Vigilance
